  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4032,
      "text": "They will say, “Why do we not see those whom we considered to be among the wicked[22]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4033,
      "text": "Is it that we mistakenly made fun of them, or do our eyes fail to see them [in the Fire]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4034,
      "text": "This is certainly true that the people of the Fire will dispute among themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4035,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “I am only a warner, and none has the right to be worshiped except Allah, the One, the Subjugator,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4036,
      "text": "Lord of the heavens and earth and all that is between them, the All-Mighty[23], Most Forgiving[24].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4037,
      "text": "Say, “This [Qur’an] is of momentous news",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4038,
      "text": "from which you are turning away.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4039,
      "text": "[And say], “I had no knowledge of the highest assembly [of angels] when they were disputing [about Adam][25].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4040,
      "text": "I have only received revelation in order to give a clear warning.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4041,
      "text": "[Remember] when your Lord said to the angels, “I am going to create a human being from clay.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4042,
      "text": "When I completed his creation and breathed into him of My spirit[26], fall down in prostration to him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4043,
      "text": "Then the angels fell down in prostration all together,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4044,
      "text": "except Iblīs, who was arrogant and became one of the disbelievers[27].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4045,
      "text": "[Allah] said, “O Iblīs, what prevented you from prostrating to whom I created with My two Hands? Did you just become proud or have you always been arrogant?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4046,
      "text": "He said, “I am better than him: You created me from fire and created him from clay.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4047,
      "text": "[Allah] said, “Then get out of here, for you are accursed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4048,
      "text": "and My curse will be upon you until the Day of Judgment.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4049,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, then give me respite until the Day of their resurrection.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4050,
      "text": "Allah said, “You are given respite,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4051,
      "text": "until the Day of the appointed time.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4052,
      "text": "Iblīs said, “By Your Glory, I will surely mislead them all,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 457,
      "ruku": 395,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4053,
      "text": "except for Your chosen slaves among them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
